\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[41].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 40}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dominica in ramis Palmarum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [H]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ugo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [= \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Ps.-Bernardus Claraevallensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , s. u.]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dicit: Consciencia bona est titulus religionis, templum Salomonis, beatitudinis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [sonst: ager benedictionis]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , ortus deliciarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... - ... in introitu misse: Domine, ne longe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 facias ... Psalmus: Deus, deus meus, respice in me ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps 21,2).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Gregorius dicit: Omnipotens sempiterne deus, qui humano generi ad himitandum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 humilitatis exemplum ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[42].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 41}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Feria II. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [I]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nnocentius dicit: Quis det oculis meis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 fontem lacrimarum, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ut fleam]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ineffabilem humani generis condicionem ... - ... in introitu misse: Iudica me ... Psalmus: Offende \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [lies: Effunde] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et fagura \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 frameam et gladium et conclude aduersus eos ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps 34,3).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... petit Gregorius: Da, quesumus, omnipotens deus, ut qui tot adversis ex nostra infirmitate deficimus ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[43].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 42}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Feria III. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [A]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 mbrosius dicit: Christus omnibus omnia factus: pauper pauperibus ... - ... in introitu misse dicit: Nos autem gloriari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 oportet, dicit eciam psalmus: Deus misereatur nostri ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps 66,2)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Gregorius dicit: Omnipotens sempiterne deus, da nobis dominice passionis sacramenta peragere ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[44].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 43}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Feria IIII. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [C]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hrysostomus super Johannem dicit, quod omnium pecuniarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 contemptum habuerunt sancti ... - ... dicens: In nomine domini etc. Psalmus: Exaudi, deus, oracionem meam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps 101,2)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Presta, quesumus, omnipotens deus: ut, qui nostris excessibus incessanter affligimur, ... In epistolam de passione domini etc. Sequitur tractatus de uirtutibus.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Rest der Spalte leer.
