\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -273\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones de tempore}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  (Sermones Fratrum Minorum)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -268\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Dominica prima in adventu domini:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Sermo primus<. >H<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ora est iam nos}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Rm 13,11). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Monet apostolus in hiis uerbis, ut relicto peccato ad virtuosa opera preparamur ... - ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (267\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Crescentes in scientia dei ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Col 1,10).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In hiis uerbis apostolus hortatur nos, ut proficiamus in duobus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (268\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... Mal. 2,7: Labia sacerdotis custodiant scientiam, angelus enim domini exercituum est.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Entspricht der Reihe \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Repertorium, Bd. 7, S. 21-37 (Bamberg, SB, Msc. theol. 173 [15. Jh., Buchstiftung des Ingolst\u228 \'e4dter Theologieprofessors {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Johannes Hebrer}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  an das Dominikanerkloster Bamberg], 49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -189\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : Distinctiones sermonum per totum annum ex epistola et evangelio, vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Leitschuh\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Bamberg I/1, S. 753; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Wegweiser, S. 309), enth\u228 \'e4lt aber zus\u228 \'e4tzlich folgende St\u252 \'fccke:
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (1) (184\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) nach Nr. 68: T 16 (In Septuagesima), sermo IV: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Simile est regnum celorum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mt 20,1).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In ista tota parabola primo sciendum, quis sit conductor ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (2) (215\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) nach Nr. 147: T 32 (Dominica IV. post Pascha), sermo II: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sit autem omnis homo uelox}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Iac 1,19).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Istud uerbum duo continet ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (3) (244\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) nach Nr. 234: T 51 (Dominica XII. post Pentecosten), sermo VI: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Admirabuntur omnes dicentes}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mc 7,37).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Duo hic nobis insinuantur, primo de Christo facta admiracio ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (4) (246\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) nach Nr. 242: T 53 (Dominica XIII. post Pentecosten), sermo III: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ite ostendite uos sacerdotibus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lc 17,44).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Saluator penitentibus necessaria duo hic innuit ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (5) (248\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) nach Nr. 247: T 54 (Dominica XIV. post Pentecosten), sermo III: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Fructus spiritus sunt caritas}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Gal 5,22).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Triplex fructus anime hic tangitur ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (6) (249\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) nach Nr. 250: T 54 (Dominica XIV. post Pentecosten), sermo VI: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Si spiritu uiuitis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Gal 5,25).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Duo hic exprimuntur, que debet homo fidelis habere ...
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Weiterhin 250\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Nr. 252 und 253 vertauscht.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Mit diesen sechs (und drei weiteren, hier nicht \u252 \'fcberlieferten) zus\u228 \'e4tzlichen St\u252 \'fccken auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 M\u252 \'fcnchen, UB, 8\u176 \'b0 95}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Landshut, Franziskaner, 14. Jh., 1. H\u228 \'e4lfte), 14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Daniel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , M\u252 \'fcnchen, UB IV, S. 95.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (268\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -273\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Alphabetisches Register:]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Abstinere debemus: in lxx\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Abstinere a quibus debet homo: Dominica iii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  post Pascha, sermone primo ... - ... Christus temptatus est multipliciter. Ibidem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Dominica XXII. post Pentecosten] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sermone vii.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Benutzungspuren: Streichungen und Korrekturen einer j\u252 \'fcngeren Hand.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 273\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -279\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (bei Bindung eingef\u252 \'fcgt) leer.
