\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Pars I: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones de tempore electi}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 , Auszug: Dominica I. in Adventu bis Dominica in Sexagesima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Vgl.\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Repertorium, Bd. 1, S. 303f., Nr. 184-195 (T1-4, T7, T11-17). In ders. Reihenfolge auch in der Hs. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Ba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (s. o.), Nr. 1-14 sowie im Druck: K\u246 \'f6ln 1482 (s. o. Digitalisat), sermo 1-13.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Dominica prima in adventu domini. Sermo.<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Cum appropinquasset Ihesus Iherosolymis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Mt 21,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tempus, quod hodie incipit et durat usque ad nativitatem domini, vocatur ab ecclesia adventus ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Dominica secunda<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Erunt signa}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lc 21,25). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In dominica precedenti lectum fuit euangelium, in quo continetur primus adventus filii in mundum ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Dominica tercia<. >C<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 um audisset}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Mt 11,2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quia sancta mater ecclesia isto tempore laudat et predicat suis fidelibus duplicem adventum filii dei in mundum. ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 etc. bis:
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Dominica in Sexagesima:]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >C<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 um turba plurima conuenirent}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lc 8,4). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hoc evangelium continet tria, scilicet Christi commendationem, predicationis utilitatem et audientium predicationem diversitates ... - ... qui designatur per centuplum. Unde Mattheus: Centuplum accipietis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et vitam eternam possidebitis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Mt 19,27f.)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

