\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (S. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Nr. 1: Beginn verloren, wohl zu Dominica I. post Pascha,\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ... Ende: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 ... cum ipso gloriemur ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (S. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Nr. 2: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 >Dominica ii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs20 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  [post Pascha]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 <. >E<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 go sum pastor bonus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Io 10,11).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Hodie in euangelio comparat se dominus pastori. In omnibus uerbis et factis ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (S. 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Nr. 3: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 >Dominica iii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs20 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 <. >P<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 lorabitis et flebitis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Io 16,20).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Hodie legitur in euangelio, quod dominus ad discipulos dixit: Vos debetis esse tristes ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (S. 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Nr. 4: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 >Dominica iiii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs20 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 <. >U<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 ado ad e}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 um ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Io 16,5).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Hodie legitur in euangelio, quod dominus dixit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  [bricht ab];
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 [ein fehlendes Doppelbl.];
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (S. 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Nr. 5: Beginn verloren, wohl zu Dominica post Ascensionem, Ende \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 ... perversos vitare valeamus ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (S. 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Nr. 6: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 >Penthecostem<. >A<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 pparuerunt apostolis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Act 2,3).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Post passionem domini discipuli eius manserunt in Ierusalem ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (S. 4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 a-b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Nr. 7: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 >Trinitatis<. >S<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 anctus, sanctus, sanctus, qui erat}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Apc 4,8). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Hodie et per totam septimanam celebratur festum trinitatis ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (S. 4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Nr. 8: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 >Dominica prima \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 [post Trinitatem]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 <. >H<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 omo quidam erat diues}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Lc 16,1).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Hodie legitur in euangelio de quodam diuite et paupere ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , bricht ab, vgl. Fortsetzung Nr. 23, Fragment I, S. 5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 a-b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 [dazwischen ein fehlendes Doppelbl sowie das innere Doppelbl der Lage = Hs. Nr. 23, Fragm. I (S. 5-8) mit Sermo Nr. 9-13, s. dort];
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (S. 9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 a-b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Nr. 14: Beginn verloren (wohl zu Dominica VII. post Trinitatem), ... Ende: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 ... consulentur dominus noster ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (S. 9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Nr. 15: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 >\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 [Dominica]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  viii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs20 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 [post Trinitatem]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 <. >A<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 ttendite a falsis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Mt 7,15).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Hodie legitur in euangelio, in cuius principio dominus nos premuniuit ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (S. 10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Nr. 16: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 >\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 [Dominica]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  viiii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs20 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 [post Trinitatem]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 <. >H<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 omo quidam habebat uillicum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Lc 16,1).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  In hoc euangelio ostenditur nobis, quod ad iudicium ueniemus ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , bricht ab;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 [ein fehlendes Doppelbl.];
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (S. 11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 a-b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Nr. 17: Beginn verloren, zu Dominica XI. post Trinitatem,\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ... Ende: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 ... pro eterna, ad quam perducat nos ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (S. 11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Nr. 18: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 >\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 [Dominica]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  xii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs20 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 [post Trinitatem]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 <. >A<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 dducunt ei surdum et mutum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Mc 7,32).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Hodie legitur in ewangelio de surdo et muto, quem curauit dominus ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (S. 12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Nr. 19: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 >\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 [Dominica]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  xiii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs20 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 [post Trinitatem]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 <. >B<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 eati oculi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Lc 10,23).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Hodie legitur in euangelio, quod dominus dixit discipulis suis: Multi reges et prophete ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , bricht ab.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Nicht bei \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  und in \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 S\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ermones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -Datenbank nachweisbar. Sermo Nr. 2-8 sowie Nr. 15-19 (sowie die zugeh\u246 \'f6rigen Sermones Nr. 10-14 in Nr. 23, Fragm. I) als Teil einer anonymen Sammlung von 95 Sermones diversi auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Bremen, StB, msb 0121}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (14. Jh., aus dem Besitz des Domstiftes St. Petri Bremen), 66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (entspricht Fragm. I), 69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  und 72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (entspricht Fragm. II), vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stahl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Bremen I, S. 166 und Initienregister.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

