\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones de conceptione et visitatione}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  BMV\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Sermo de conceptione<. >N<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ouum hominem creatus deus super terram femina circumdabit uirum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. Ier 31,22). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... in hiis verbis primo notatur noua ... beate uirginis ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Item de conceptione<. >P<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 lantauerat autem dominus deus paradisum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Gn 2,8).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Uerba preposita ad commendacionem beate uirginis Marie sunt sumpta ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >De visitacione beate virginis Marie<. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Exsurgens autem Maria}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Lc 1,39).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cum igitur uirgo angelico nuncio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [sonst: annuntio] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 consensit, angelus ab ea discessit ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Die letzte Predigt nach {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Schneyer}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Repertorium, Bd. 4, S. 338, Nr. 4a: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Nicolaus de Lyra}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Postilla super evangelia dominicalia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Die ersten beiden Predigten bei \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  und in Sermones-DB nicht nachweisbar.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

