\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Henricus de Frimaria}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De decem praeceptis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Prolog:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >A<Vdi{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Israel precepta domini}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. Dt 4,1 und 6,3).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In uerbis istis prepositis spiritus sanctus circa diuina precepta tria tangit: Prima ostendit, quod sunt hilariter audienda ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Text:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Primum preceptum<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Appropriate respicit personam patris quantum ad uoluntarium obsequium}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... - ... quod vinum dignetur prestare gloriose virginis Marie filius benedictus, qui cum patre ... 1444. >Expliciunt decem precepta<.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck:{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17  GW 12199-12212}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , u. a. De decem praeceptis [...]. [Paris: Philippe Pigouchet, um 1491]. GW 12200, eingesehenes Digitalisat: http://archive.org/stream/OEXV794_P1#page/n5/mode/2up. Zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung (ohne diese Hs.) vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Incipits, Nr. 526 mit Suppl.; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  RB, Nr. 3172; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Zumkeller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Nr. 325 mit Nachtrag. Zum Autor und Werk vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stroick\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Heinrich von Friemar, S. 37-42; Robert G. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Warnock\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 VL 3 (1981), Sp. 730-737, hier Sp. 733.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

