\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Nr. 1: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quidam peccator correctus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: correptus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 gravissima infirmitate rogabat deum, ut eum tolleret de hoc mundo ... - ... timorem purgatorii hec valet ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 auch in{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17  Uppsala, UB, C 285}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , und C 313, 93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Nr. 2: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ex miraculis beate Marie virginis. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quidam pueri clerici ludum pile ante quandam ecclesiam exercebant}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... - ... usque in finem vite sue seruiuit.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Poncelet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Miraculorum index, Nr. 1491; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 3: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Caesarius Heisterbacensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : Dialogus Miraculorum, cap. XII/36: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cesarius dicit: In monasterio sancti Salvatoris ordinis Cisterciensis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Zisterzienserinnenkloster Salvatorberg bei Aachen?] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 defuncta est vna puella decem annorum, qui clare die conuentu stantem in choro chorum intrans ... - ... sicque ad celum euolauit.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ed.: Joseph \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Strange\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Hg.), Caesarii Heisterbacensis monachi ordinis Cisterciensis Dialogus Miraculorum, K\u246 \'f6ln, Bonn, Br\u252 \'fcssel 1851, Bd. 2, S. 344f.;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 4: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Caesarius Heisterbacensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : Dialogus Miraculorum, cap. IX/51: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In Francia miles quidam fuit tante deuocionis, ut ubicumque corpus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [eingef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  videret, illuc prostratus illud adoraret. ... - ... in fide confortatur et glorificauit deum.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Ed.: Ebd., Bd. 2, S. 206;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Nr. 5: LA, cap. 127 (Auszug): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sacerdos quidam cuiusdam parochie et honeste vite nullam missam nisi missam beate Marie sciebat}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... - ... celebrare debeat imperauit. D\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [eo]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  g\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ratias]; \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Poncelet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Miraculorum index, Nr. 1597; Ed. (s. o. 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), Bd. 2, S. 911, Z. 135-140.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

