\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones de tempore}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  diversi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Sermo de natiuitate domini<. >I<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 nuenietis infantem positum in presepio}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Lc 2,12).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In verbis istis circa nativitatem Christi quattuor notantur. Primo nativitatis eius utilitas ... - ... diues efficiaris in regno suo. Ipso prestante.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Nach Sermones-DB: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Petrus Plank (Piper)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Nr. 13 (nach clm 4791).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Sermo de sacerdotibus<. >U<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Os estis genus electum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (I Pt 2,9). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hec sunt verba beati Petri: Vos, qui estis sacerdotes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 domini, ... - ... nec aures audiunt.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Auch in{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17  Jena, ThULB, Ms. Klosterbibl. 5}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Th\u252 \'fcringen, 1431-33, geschrieben haupts\u228 \'e4chlich von einem Kaplan in Magdala sw. Jena, sowie in Erfurt), 83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Klein-Ilbeck/Ott\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Jena 2, S. 258. Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Naumburg, DomstB, Nr. 27}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , dort der in der Jenaer Hs. folgende Text (De octo turpitudinibus luxuriae).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Sermo de passione domini<. >O<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  vos omnes, qui transitis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Lam 1,12). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sanctus Augustinus doctor venerabilis considerans penalitatis Christi acerbitatem et nostre salutis ... - ... deduxit eam in civitate Iherusalem ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; 24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  am Rand querst\u228 \'e4ndiger Eintrag: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Andreas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Sermo in die assumpcionis beate Marie virginis<. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >H<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 odie magnificata est anima mea}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Idt 12,18). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Verbum illud poterat dicere beata virgo Maria, quando ad celum fuit assumpta ... - ... regnat cum patre et spiritu sancto in eternum, quod nobis concedat ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Nach \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Repertorium, Bd. 3, S. 442, Nr. 121: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Johannes Contractus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Korz) OM (s. o. 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

