\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones in die Paschae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Sermo in die Pasche<. >I<n illo tempore. Maria Magdalena et Maria \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Iacobi ...] (Mc 16,1). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Et quia in ... dominica celebratur resurrectio Christi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , qui fuit causa leticie et hominibus et angelis ... - ... ipsi custodes dixerunt Christum resurrexisse. Unde Mattheus ultimo: Quidam de custodibus uenerunt in ciuitatem ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mt 28,11)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Deo gracia.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Sermo in die Pasche<. >H<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ec est dies}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps 117,24). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Propheta David ante incarnacionem Christi pluribus annis cognouit in spiritu resurrectionem Christi ... - ... consortes in eterna gloria. Quod nobis concedat ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Item sermo paschalis<. >S<urgens Ihesus mane ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Mc 16,9). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In hiis verbis describit ewangelista resurrectionem Christi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... - ... facie ad faciem dominum videbit. Quod nobis prestare dignetur.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >De die dominico \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 notabile modicum<. >D<iem sabbati sanctifices \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Ex 20,8).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Istis verbis ostendit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dominus diem dominicum venerari cum devocione ... - ... creator horum omnium. Qui vivit et regnat deus etc. Sit laus deo patri cum filio sancto simil paraclito. Hyr is nymme\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Anno 45<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Nicht bei \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Repertorium, und in Sermones-DB nachweisbar.
