\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 244\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Ps.-{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bernardus Claraevallensis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Epistola ad Raimundum de regimine rei familiaris}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 [E]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pistola sancti Bernhardi ad quendam nobilem militem de cura et modo rei familiaris utilius gubernande etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [G]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Racioso et felici militi Raymondo domino castri Ambrosii B\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ernhardus]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in senium deductus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [salutem]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Doceri petisti a nobis de cura et modo rei familiaris utilius gubernande ... - ... bibet cum eo doloris calicem, quem optauit, ad quem eam perducat sua dampnabilis senectus. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit epistola Bernhardi de modo regendi se et familiam.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 PL 182, 647A-654A}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Zur Verfasserfrage (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bernardus Silvestris?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Glorieux,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  Pour rev. Migne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 70; C. D. M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Cossar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , The German Translation of the Pseudo-Bernhardine Epistola de cura rei familiaris, G\u246 \'f6ppingen 1975 (G\u246 \'f6ppinger Arbeiten zur Germanistik 166), S, 97-102; W. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 H\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ver\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 VL 1 (1978), Sp. 758.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

