\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (381\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -385\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Repetitio zu {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Decretales}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Gregorii papae IX., lib. II, tit. 28, cap. 8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Capitulum \u8218 \'82Ex racione\rquote , de appellacionibus. In nomine sancte et indiuidue trinitatis ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Vorrede:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Illustres, nobiles et generosi domini, doctores clarissimi, uenerabiles patres et domini prestantissimi. Lecturus capitulum \u8218 \'82Ex racione\rquote  sub titulo \u8218 \'82De appellacionibus, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (recusationibus et relationibus\rquote : X II,28,8, vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Friedberg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  II, Sp. 412) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 situatum, per egregium et famossisimum virum dominum {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannem de Breittenbach}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , utriusque iuris doctorem, nostre inclite facultatis iuridice ordinarium dignissimum, promotorem meum, michi assignatum, tria per ordinem restant per me facienda: prima rubricam ad precedentes continuabo ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (282\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Casus in \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [...] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sic figuro: Duo clerici appelauerunt a sentencia contra eos lata ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (282\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Text X II,28,8, s. o.:]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ex racione et infra. Verum si appellacionem biennio elapso interpositam a sentencia ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Beginn der Auslegung:]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Noto primo, quod tempus anni siue biennium, quod datur ad prosecucionem appellacionis ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (283\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Pro intellectu rubri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [cae]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et capituli quero primo, quo iure sit adiuventa appellacio ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (283\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quero secundo pro intellectum capituli et glose: Numquid impeditus in primo anno debet indecenter \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  habere secundum annum ...
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Fortsetzung (pars III) s. u. 387\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

