\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (386\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ){\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Ansprache}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  des Gepr\u252 \'fcften an die Vertreter der Fakult\u228 \'e4t, mit Bitte um Doktorpromotion und \u8222 \'84Verheiratung\ldblquote  mit der Jurisprudenz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Conuerto me nunc ad dominos doctores, promotores meos venerandos. Clarissimi doctores, patres et domini celeberrimi, crebrius mecum tacitus revolui animo illud reuerenciam homo homini quid prestet ... Ad vos dominos meos doctores famossisimos ... et vobis venerabili et excellentissimo vtriusque iuris doctore, iuridiceque \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (386\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  facultatis ordinario {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johanne de Breyttenbach}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , deinde a vobis domino {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cristoforo Eckel}}\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24  de Freiberga\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , decretorum doctore eximio, obnixe et deuote \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 obsecrans a uestris paternitatibus laureari insignibusque exornare doctoralibus hautque sacratissima iuriscanonici scienciam michi peto desponsari\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et vinculo matrimoniali copulari, vnde quia ad onera matrimonii sufferenda, uxor cum dote tradenda est ... \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Ideoque insignia doctoralia vicedotis michi postulanda censui\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... ad gloriam dei omnipotentis matrisque eius castissime, qui vivit et regnat ... Amen.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

