\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 463\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Nachtrag vom Schreiber:]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De trinitate}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De trinitate hoc tenendum est: In una substantia tres sunt persone, scilicet pater, filius et spiritus sanctus. Pater a nullo generatur ... - ... patri tamen appropriatur potentia, filio sapientia,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 spiritui sancto bonitas etc.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Beginn \u252 \'fcbereinstimmend mit {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Augsburg, SuStB, 4\u176 \'b0 Cod 67, 99}}\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Gehrt\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Augsburg VI, S. 128.}

