\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [T1: Dominica I. Adventus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >E<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 runt signa in sole et luna}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Lc 21,25)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . In hoc evangelio salvator tangit quattuor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 signi multiplicis precessiones ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [T2: Dominica II. Adventus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >J<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ohannes cum audisset}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Mt 11,2)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Considerandum primo est, quod Herodes Antipas incarceravit Johannem ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;
