\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (215\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb-va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >I<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ntroibo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in domum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Ps 5,8).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In uerbis propositis propheta exemplo suo tria nobis facienda demonstrat: primo scilicet templum siue ecclesiam uisitare ... - ... domus dei et porta celi et tamquam ingressus glorie, ad quam nos perducat etc. ...
