\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Commentaria in Vetus Testamentum (Materiae librorum historialium Bibliae), Gn bis Ion.}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [am oberen Seitenrand:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Liber Genesis<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ].\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >N<Ota Lyra super super }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 (!)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Genesim ponit septem regulas exponendi sacram scripturam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Prima est de domino Ihesu Christi et eius corpore mistico, quod est ecclesia, ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Capitulum primum. >I<n principio videlicet temporis vel productionis rerum deus creauit ... - ... sperabat resurgere cum Christo resurgente, qui sit benedictus ... Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Exodus. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >N<Ota Isidorus dicit primo Ethymologiarum, quod lex data est pro communi utilitate}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... Capitulum I. >I<n hac parte agitur de exitu filiorum Israhel de Egipto ... - ... manebant in eodem loco\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ex 40,35)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Deo laus et gloria per infinita seculorum secula.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sequitur Leuiticus liber<. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ){\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >C<Irca inicium libri Leuitici Hoscia }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 (?) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 capitulum I}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Nota in Genesi distinctus est populus fidelis ab infidelibus, sed in Exodo data est generaliter. Sed in Leuitico datur preceptum in \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [gestrichen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 generali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 speciali ... - ... dabit quintam partem estimacionis supra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et habebit domum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Lv 27,15).;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [am oberen Seitenrand:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sequitur liber Numeri<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >N<Ota in Genesi agitur de fidelis populi electione}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , cui etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [lex erat danda]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . In Exodo agitur de legis dacione populo electo ... - ... supra Jordanem contra Jericho\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Nm 33,48)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -50\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sequitur Devteronomius. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >D<Eclaratio sermonum tuorum }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ... (Ps 118,130).}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Sic scribitur in psalmo. Hoc uerbum potest aplicari ad presentem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Unde iste procedit secundum quadruplicem modum ... - ... que fecit Moyses coram universo Israhel \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Dt 34,12).;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (50\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Ios, (58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Idc, (66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Rt, (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -78\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 I Sm, (78\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 II Sm, (85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 III Rg, (91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 IV Rg, (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Tb, (103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Idt, (107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Est, (109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 I Mcc, (116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 II Mcc, (123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Esr,
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [am oberen Seitenrand:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Daniel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >P<Rophetauit eciam Daniel in Caldea}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , qui secundum Iosephum et Ephyphanium de semine regio Iude fuit, secundum Septuaginta uero de tribu Leui. ... - ... deuorati sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in momento coram eo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Dn 14,41).;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ionas >Visio< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >E<t factum est uerbum domini ad Ionam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... - ... inter dexteram et sinistram suam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et iumenta multa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ion 1,1-4,11)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ein Text mit diesem Incipit auch \u252 \'fcberliefert in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 G\u252 \'fcssing (\u214 \'d6sterreich), Franziskanerkloster, Cod. 1/44, 1}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 r}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 -219}}\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (hier mit dem Titel \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Materie omnium librorum historialium tocius Biblie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  geschrieben bzw. kompiliert von {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Johannes Pretznauer}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), vgl. Datierte Hss. \u214 \'d6sterreich VII\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Bd. 1, Nr. 319, S. 179, Bd. 2, Abb. 466;\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Yates\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Descriptive inventories I, S. 36f., und http://manuscripta.at/?ID=4490 (Stand 08.10.13), sowie {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Klosterneuburg, Augustiner-Chorherrenstift, CCl 193 (Ybbs?, um 1420), 3}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 ra}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 -133}}\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (hier als \u8218 \'82In Alexandri de Villa Dei Registrum Bibliae\lquote ), vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Haidinger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Klosterneuburg II, S. 148. Nicht bei \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RB, nachgewiesen, aber wahrscheinlich abh\u228 \'e4ngig von {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Nicolaus de Lyra}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Regulae expositionis sacrae Scripturae I-VII sive claves}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Stegm\u252 \'fcller}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 , RB 4, Nr. 5827}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (nach {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[2].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 M\u252 \'fcnchen, BSB, Clm 5444 f. 449-451}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Rest von 137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.}

