\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 2.\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 De aetatibus mundi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nota beatus Ysidorus primo libro Romanorum }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 (!)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  suorum dicit, quod quinta etas mundi incipit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  a transmigratione Babylonis et sexta etas incipit a natiuitate Christi ... - ... a destructione templi usque ad perfectam restaurandi licentiam sic computandum est Hebreorum captiuitas.
