\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Prologus:] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >P<ostquam a paradisi gaudiis repulsum est genus humanum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in istam peregrinationem presentis uite ueniens cecum cor ab spiritali intellectu habet. ... - ... quomodo optet uidere presentiam sponsi sui, quomodo desideret, edicat. Sequitur \lquote Osculetur me osculis oris sui\lquote  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Ct 1,1); (159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Expositio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Uox ecclesie ad Christum<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >O<sculetur ... }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 (Ct 1,1).}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  In principio huius cantici mater loquens dicitur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  introducitur petens sancti spiritus graciam ... angelos ad eam dominus, patriarchas et prophetas miserat, spiritualia dona deferentes ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Osculetur ... }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 (Ct 1,1)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 . Suspirans enim sancta ecclesia pro aduentu}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  mediatoris dei et hominum ... - ... in convallibus et fecibus peccatorum. A quibus nos purgat Ihesus Marie filius et ad montes eterni gaudii perducat ... Amen. >Et sic finita sunt cantica canticorum<. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: CCSL 144, S. 3-46. Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Stegm\u252 \'fcller}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 , RB, Nr. 2639}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; CPL Nr. 1709. Zur Autorschaft Gregors vgl. P. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Verbraken\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: CCSL 144, S. VIIf., CPPM II, Nr. 2290.}

