\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 204\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -220\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Notabilia et dubia circa quartum librum Sententiarum ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De peccato mortale et veniale}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >N<otabilia et dubia, que circa quartum Sententiarum}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  [occurunt]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 . Queritur, utrum quolibet homo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  datoque non habeat peccatum mortale, sed veniale, utrum tunc de necessitate teneatur confiteri ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (204\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Nota in peccato sunt quinque gradus, per quos cognoscitur, utrum sit mortale uel ueniale ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... >C<onsequenter queritur, utrum quolibet homo, postquam mortaliter peccauit, habita oportunitate confessoris, teneatur confiteri ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (206\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... >C<onsequenter queritur, utrum sacerdos absoluere possit sub specie ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 etc. bis\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... >C<onsequenter queritur, utrum status matrimonii sit melior et utilior ac nobilior statu uirginali ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (219\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Consequenter queritur, quare non sunt plura uel pauciora sacramenta quam septem ... uerbum, id est predicacio, que, si fiat ab indigno, aliis prodest et sibi nocet ... etc.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Eingeteilt in 20 Quaestiones. Nicht bei \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 ller,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  RS\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  nachgewiesen. Am Ende Zitat aus Glosse zum Decretum Gratiani, pars II, c. 78.}

