\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De composicione sacre scripture. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >I<nter ceteras regulas de expositione sacre scripture, quas sapientes tradiderunt}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , tredecim diligenter sunt notande. Quarum prima est, quod propria nomina in sacra scriptura debent exponi secundum suas interpretaciones ... - ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (232\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Tredecima regula est, quod sacra scriptura in diuersis locis preter litteralem sensum habet exposicionem, scilicet allegoricum, tropoloycum et anagoycum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ausf\u252 \'fchrungen zum vierfachen Schriftsinn:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Est autem allegoriam, quando per unum factum indicatur aliud factum ... - ... Est eciam sciendum, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (232\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod in sensu litterali seu historiali inter quatuor precipuos sanctos doctores preualuit beatus Ieronimus, in tropoloya Gregorius, in allegoria Ambrosius, in anagoya Augustinus.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Die abschlie\u223 \'dfenden Definitionen zum vierfachen Schriftsinn nach {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Bonaventura}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Breviloquium}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Prologus, vgl. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 http://www.ultramontes.pl/breviloquium_prooemium.htm\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Stand 08.10.13).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Halle, Qu. Cod. 93d (Magdeburg 1427), 203}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 r}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 -206}}\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Fliege\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Quedlinburg, S. 109; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 N\u252 \'fcrnberg, GNM, Hs 22 401 (Schwaben?, Anfang 15. Jh., aus Benediktinerkloster Reinhardsbrunn), 52}}\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hilg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , N\u252 \'fcrnberg GNM 1, S. 33 (hier nur regula 13?); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[2].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Berlin, SBB-PK, Ms. theol. lat. qu. 167 (Kartause Erfurt, um 1470), 9}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[2].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 r}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[2].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 -11}}\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Achten,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Berlin I,1,1, S. 89, vgl. dazu den Eintrag im Bibliothekskatalog der Erfurter Kartause (um 1475), MBK II, S. 301\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 39\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -302\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : \u8222 \'84Tractatus multum magistralis et utilis de expositione sacre scripture et quomodo res et quomodo dictiones in ea significent diversimode\ldblquote .}

