\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De modo sermonicandi. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >F<rater, tuis petitionibus obtemperans, ostendere volo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in paucis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 modum sermonicandi et collaciones faciendi. Notandum tamen, primo quod\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [zwei W\u246 \'f6rter unleserlich]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  thema sumendum est de sacro canone ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (233\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... >S<equitur de subdiuisione, unde sciendum est, quod in themate est quedam diuisio propria ... - ... turpiter clamat, quod omnia sunt vicia peccatorum.}

