\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 240\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -265\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Expositio super librum generationis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  (Mt 1,1-17)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (240\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Prologus:] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [L]Iber generacionis}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  (Mt 1,1).}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Dulcissima verba huius evangelii \u8218 \'82dulciora super mel et favum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\lquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps 18,11)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Quid, queso, dulcius, quid iocundius audire li\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [brum?]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  generationis Ihesu Christi. In hoc sanctissimo ewangelio spiritus sanctus proponit nobis celestem scalam, per quam Christus, eternum lumen, saluator noster, ... descendit de excelso throno ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (240\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -265\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Text:] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [A]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 braham genuit Ysaac}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  (Mt 1,2),}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  ubi incipit prima quattuordena generationum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... - ... et terrena sapientia. Et sic iste liber clauditur ... spiritus sancti in nomine eterne trinitatis.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Nicht bei \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RB, nachgewiesen.}

