\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (203\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -209\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Epistolae canonicae apostolorum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (203\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Iac\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Incipit prologus super canonicas septem epistolas. Jacobi<: >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 N<On ita est ordo apud Grecos}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , qui integre sapiunt fidemque rectam sectantur, epistolarum septem, que canonice nuncupantur. ... - ... nec sancte scripture veritatem poscentibus denegabo. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Auctor incertus [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hieronymus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ?]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Prologus epistolarum canonicarum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Stegm\u252 \'fcller}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 , RB I, Nr. 809}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , vgl. PL 29, Sp. 821C-832A),\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf6  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (204\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Text;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -207\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 I-II Pt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Incipit argumentum in epistolam sancti Petri<: >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 D<Iscipulus }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [sonst: Discipulos]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  salvatoris invicti toto orbe diffusus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et peregrinus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [sonst: diffusos et peregrinos] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in hoc seculo monstrat ... - ... vico Bethsaida, frater Andree apostoli.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Walafridus Strabo}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Argumentum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Stegm\u252 \'fcller}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 , RB I, Nr. 812}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , PL 114, Sp. 679B-C),\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf6  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -206\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Text I Pt; (206\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Incipit argumentum in \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [epistolam]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  canonicam secundam<: >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 S<Imon P