\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs20 - Fragment 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : Querstreifen zwischen Bl. 91/92, 103/104, 115/116, 127/128, 152/153, 166/167, Schriftspiegel: Spaltenbreite ca. 12,5, 1 Spalte, ca. 2 Zeilen pro Streifen erhalten, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5704[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Textura}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5060[0].5064/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 14. Jh., 2. H\u228 \'e4lfte}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Rubriziert: rote Lombarden und rot ausgef\u252 \'fcllte Majuskeln. Inhalt: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Aelius Donatus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs20 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Ars minor}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , sp\u228 \'e4tmittelalterlicher Normaltext, z. B. (Bl. 166/167, links) [Kap. 11: De nomine: ... Tertia declinatio quot literas terminales habet? Decem. Quas? ... s ut civitas,]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  t ut caput, x ut felix. Quot ter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 [minaciones? ...]; (Bl. 166/167, rechts) [Kap. 14: Pronomen quid est? ... Figure pronominum quot sunt?]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Due. Que? Simplex vt ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; [Kap. 17: De adverbio: ... da temporis. ut hodie nuper aliquando; numeri, ut semel bis;] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 negandi, ut ... aut\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 non\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 affirmandi,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  [ut etiam quinni; ...]; (Bl. 115/116, links) [Kap. 17: Aduerbia localia sunt] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 vel in loco vel de loco uel ad locum uel per locum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  [... Sed in loco] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 et de loco eandem significacionem habent, ut intus ...
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Vgl. Ed.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schwenke,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Donat-Type, S. 38 (Kap. 11), S. 39 (Kap. 14), S. 41 (Kap. 17).}

