\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bubnov\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , ebd., cap. 17, S. 345, Z. 17 - S. 346, Z. 7 (vgl. PL 139, Sp. 137D-138A: cap. LV);
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 1-3) [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 cap. 17, Schluss\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Omnis octogonus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [sexies aream quater. Omnis] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ennagonus multiplicationem vii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 es\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  diductionem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [quinquies ...] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 diductionem vii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 es\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Si uideris consequentiam nullus e\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [rror impediet tibi ceteras multiangulas figu]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ras persequenti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [sonst: prosequenti]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bubnov\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , ebd., cap. 17, S. 346, Z. 7-8 (vgl. PL 139, Sp. 142A-B: cap. LXV), in \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bubnovs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Ed. Schluss abweichend: Et ceteri ad hanc consequentiam., vgl. aber die mit diesem Fragment \u252 \'fcbereinstimmende Lesart nach \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Olleris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  in der Anm.;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 3-8) [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 cap. 10\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Trigoni hysopleuri, cuius sunt singula \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [latera xxx, embadi pedes compreh]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 endere si uis, prius katetum sic inuenias. Latus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [unum in se duc, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] ... - ... [... dimidiam multiplicatio, i]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 d est xv \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [per]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  xxvi, pedes inuenies embadi cccxc pedes.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bubnov\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , ebd., cap. 10, S. 342, Z. 13 - S. 343, Z. 2 (vgl. PL 139, Sp. 135C: cap. XLIX);
